    "independenceMethod": "After repair publication and exact 21-file/20-input verification, retrieved the current EER again and compared actual bytes. Reconsidered AppendixIII D revised cohort tables and Articles3.3–3.6,4.1–4.3,7.4 before the finished record. Re-established English instruction/tests,33components180EC,neutralfirst formal Brain&Cognition route,minor15/restrictedpsychologychoice10,thesis14/135ECspringgate andnoncredit test-subjectobligation. Returned to actual selected course evidence, including current emotion-regulation/survey leadership content, empirical clinical-health interviewing, educational youth toolkit work, systematic review/meta-analysis in R and description-only cognition/economics/laboratory evidence. Challenged whether complementary sociology, AI/business, cellular biology or computer vision establishes psychology itself: only the substantial psychological core and explicitly limited complements justify these programmes. Re-examined all positive/blank comparator placements; generic moral philosophy cannot substitute for professional psychological ethics, while actual interviewing, school prevention and development planning establish specific partial functions. Same AI performed repair and this separately identified source-first pass; validators alone were not academic verification.",
